# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 2/5, item 30
# Base: apply after 0026-0029.
#
# Wires exact verified speculation into Deep2Engine::generate for greedy decode
# and adds an end-to-end authority executable.
#
# The gate requires:
# - baseline greedy == speculative greedy token-for-token
# - real 32B target model
# - real Vulkan GPU target path, strict no CPU fallback
# - >= 85 measured VERIFIED output tokens/s
# - >1 verified output token per target speculative pass
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0030_spec_generate_integration_85tps_gate.patch

